{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_artifacts_presentation_boundary", "label": "Python Presentation Boundary", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/presentation-boundary.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_presentation_boundary_build_project_result", "label": "build_project_result()", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/presentation-boundary.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Combines the authoritative ProjectPNCNetwork with the LoadFlowNetworkResult calculated for that exact network; it generates no topology, routes no cables and runs no load flow, limiting itself to rounding, ordering, violation grouping and bounding-box calculation."}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_presentation_boundary_project_optimization_result", "label": "ProjectOptimizationResult", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/presentation-boundary.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Strict Pydantic models reject unknown fields, freeze assignment and forbid non-finite floats, though nested lists and the raw GeoJSON dict stay mutable - the contract is assignment-frozen rather than deeply immutable."}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_presentation_boundary_geojson_contract", "label": "Stable GeoJSON Feature Contract", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/presentation-boundary.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Features appear in a fixed order (substation, WTGs by ID, segments by ID, deduplicated poles) with stable top-level IDs and a bbox, so clients can render one predictable schema; pole summaries are calculated from unique physical structures rather than route-local pole counts."}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_presentation_boundary_reuse_pnc_geojson_conversion", "label": "Reuse PNC GeoJSON Conversion", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/presentation-boundary.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "CRS conversion and base feature construction have one implementation instead of two drifting copies; the presentation layer enriches the freshly built collection in place to avoid a redundant deep copy, and never mutates the internal ProjectPNCNetwork."}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_presentation_boundary_fail_on_reconciliation_errors", "label": "Fail on Reconciliation Errors", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/presentation-boundary.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Silently joining partial electrical data to the wrong physical asset would produce a credible-looking but unsafe engineering result, so duplicate or unknown identifiers, mismatched associations and non-finite values raise PresentationDataMismatchError."}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_presentation_boundary_topology_only_after_solver_failure", "label": "Topology-Only Output After Solver Failure", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/presentation-boundary.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Non-convergence is a valid analytical outcome, not a presentation failure: the physical map, feature IDs and bbox are still returned with null telemetry and an explicit LOAD_FLOW_NOT_CONVERGED violation so users can inspect the proposed network and the map schema stays stable."}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_presentation_boundary_separate_presentation_from_computation", "label": "Keep Presentation Separate from Computation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/presentation-boundary.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rounding and JSON naming cannot affect the engineering models used for validation; nullable telemetry keys let clients render one stable schema without probing whether properties exist."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_artifacts_presentation_boundary", "target": "docs_artifacts_mvp_minimum_viable_product_py_016", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/artifacts/presentation-boundary.md", "source_location": "SURGE-PY-016 adds app.presentation", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_artifacts_presentation_boundary_build_project_result", "target": "docs_artifacts_pnc_network_assembly_project_pnc_network", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/artifacts/presentation-boundary.md", "source_location": "Purpose and boundary", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_artifacts_presentation_boundary_build_project_result", "target": "docs_artifacts_presentation_boundary_project_optimization_result", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/artifacts/presentation-boundary.md", "source_location": "Purpose and boundary", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_artifacts_presentation_boundary_project_optimization_result", "target": "docs_artifacts_presentation_boundary_geojson_contract", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/artifacts/presentation-boundary.md", "source_location": "GeoJSON contract", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_artifacts_presentation_boundary_reuse_pnc_geojson_conversion", "target": "optimisation_python_app_pnc_geojson_network_to_feature_collection", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/artifacts/presentation-boundary.md", "source_location": "Deliberate decisions", "weight": 1.0}, {"source":